W, a Silica edge, joined through the Python sentinel R
the test-only tick and clock frames, sent to both; the peer saw: tick: closed; clock: closed; clock with a later reading: closed
  both nodes: [tempus audit] admitted peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f tempus_edge, token and proof of possession N
  both nodes: [tempus audit] protocol_error peer=224c0c0c5b08df0f not a request: unknown_atom N
